    Derived from commit 0dde4b6882144309263ac465375971a5c39b492d
    ("docs: add committed backlog of open work", 16 June 2026),
    the state of the main branch after the v1.10 release.

Its menu structure, preference set and user-facing strings were used as the
basis for the equivalent parts of this app. The hiding mechanism is not
derived from it: the technique Hidden Bar uses stopped working in macOS 27,
and CleanMenuBar's replacement was written from measurements of the new
behaviour rather than from their source.

With thanks to Dwarves Foundation and to everyone who built and maintained
